---
description: Prefer one shared type within a package backend; no parallel DTO mirrors
globs: "packages/**/{service,query-service,plugin}/**/*.{rs,ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Package backend types

Service, query-service, and plugin are one package backend — share types freely.

- One type per concept. Do not mirror action/table DTOs as parallel domain structs with the same fields.
- Prefer importing `crate::tables::*` / package table types over copying shapes.
- Distinct names only when the shape or role actually differs (e.g. `SessionRow` vs aggregated `Session`).
